  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "In Freundlich adsorption isotherm at moderate pressure, the extent of adsorption <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math> is directly proportional to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "OauIi",
      "text": "zero",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XwV7a",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Vao63",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "JOUvO",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8734;</mo></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Freundlich gave a relation between the amount of the gas adsorbed per unit mass of the adsorbent&nbsp;(m) and the pressure (p). This is known as Freundlich&rsquo;s adsorption isotherm.</p><p>As per Freundlich adsorption isotherm</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>KP</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence answer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
